    "start": 1.571,
    "end": 5.032,
    "zh": "第19课 累了",
    "zh_hant": "第19課 累了"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "and thirsty",
    "start": 5.012,
    "end": 6.233,
    "zh": "而且渴了",
    "zh_hant": "而且渴了"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.534,
    "end": 11.475,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Why do the children thank their mother?",
    "start": 13.677,
    "end": 16.778,
    "zh": "为什么孩子们要感谢他们的妈妈？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼孩子們要感謝他們的媽媽？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What's the matter children?",
    "start": 19.159,
    "end": 21.58,
    "zh": "孩子们，怎么了？",
    "zh_hant": "孩子們，怎麼了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "We're tired ...",
    "start": 22.741,
    "end": 24.59,
    "zh": "我们累了……",
    "zh_hant": "我們累了……"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "...",
    "start": 24.24,
    "end": 25.13,
    "zh": "……",
    "zh_hant": "……"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "and thirsty Mum.",
    "start": 25.122,
    "end": 27.003,
    "zh": "而且渴了，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "而且渴了，媽媽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Sit down here.",
    "start": 27.723,
    "end": 29.624,
    "zh": "在这里坐下。",
    "zh_hant": "在這裡坐下。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Are you all right now?",
    "start": 31.245,
    "end": 33.166,
    "zh": "你们现在好了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你們現在好了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "No we aren't.",
    "start": 33.866,
    "end": 36.287,
    "zh": "不，我们还没好。",
    "zh_hant": "不，我們還沒好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Look!",
    "start": 37.528,
    "end": 38.448,
    "zh": "看！",
    "zh_hant": "看！"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "There's an ice cream man.",
    "start": 39.089,
    "end": 41.731,
    "zh": "有一个卖冰淇淋的人。",
    "zh_hant": "有一個賣冰淇淋的人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Two ice cream please.",
    "start": 43.493,
    "end": 46.274,
    "zh": "请来两份冰淇淋。",
    "zh_hant": "請來兩份冰淇淋。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Here you are children.",
    "start": 48.236,
    "end": 50.458,
    "zh": "给你们，孩子们。",
    "zh_hant": "給你們，孩子們。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Thanks Mum.",
    "start": 51.759,
    "end": 53.06,
    "zh": "谢谢，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "謝謝，媽媽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "These ice creams are nice.",
    "start": 54.561,
    "end": 58.184,
    "zh": "这些冰淇淋很好吃。",
    "zh_hant": "這些冰淇淋很好吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Are you all right now?",
    "start": 59.625,
    "end": 61.526,
    "zh": "你们现在好了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你們現在好了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Yes we are thank you!",
    "start": 62.548,
    "end": 65.81,
    "zh": "是的，我们好了，谢谢你！",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我們好了，謝謝你！"
  }
]
